From faf288c2e5d61de546d7b771b354a8f4bcf0bedf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 09:57:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use MASM-compatible native Windows assembly flags and
 fixtures

Regression: native MSVC configuration analysis fails with C/C++ compiler switches on raw and preprocessed assembly actions, and lacks /WX. The patched configuration passes the analysis regression. Native Windows execution and fresh emitted verification remain required.
---
